window.products.push({"id":419005,"name":"JMEXSUSS C6 Strawberry String Lights Plug in 33ft 100 LED Outdoor Waterproof Twinkle Fairy String Lights with 8 Modes Multicolor Christmas String Ligh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sGZ49j7aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Strawberry Shape & Durability】 The string lights use a unique strawberry design and firm materials to make them durable, not easy to break. It greatly improves the brightness and durability of the lights. In addition, our string light has no pungent plastic smell and excessive glue residue. Note: The light string can Not be connected, suitable for a small scenes decor. 【Wide Use & Excellent Atmosphere】 The strawberry string lights shine bright like diamond and emit charming light. on Christmas, you can wrap it on the Christmas tree to create a joyful atmosphere. In summer, you can wrap it around the fence or aisle to add a fun atmosphere. You can also use it to add vibrancy atmosphere to old cars or bikes that can’t work but you love. Wondeful lights for wedding backgrounds, parties, terraces, gardens, yards, porches, street decorating contest decorations. 【Safety & Waterproof】 The outdoor waterproof light string has passed American UL588 and IP44 waterproof certification, and every LED straberry light is filled with hot-melt adhesive layers. Therefore, you can safely use and place the lights anywhere, no worry about the rain/snow weather. Notice: Transformer is NOT waterproof. Please let it stay in a dry place. 【8 Modes & Timer】 8 modes of strawberry lights string for your option to fit various occasions and moods. Press the button for 3 seconds to set and reset the timer and the green indicator light will light up, means that the timer is on. It will stay on for 6 hours and turn off for 18 hours every 24 hours. No worry about forgetting to turn off the lights. 【After-sales Service】 If there is any problem with the star fairy string lights, please contact us in time, We are willing to provide you with return or refund services, and will not let you bear any losses due to product quality.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81sGZ49j7aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JMEXSUSS","source_asin":"B0894SF9CZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0894SF9CZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0894SF9CZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
