window.products.push({"id":419058,"name":"Iyasu Home Twin Japanese Floor Mattress- Shikibuton Floor Bed- Japanese Futon Mattress- Japanese futon Floor Mattress for Adults- 75 by 39 in. Japanes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o-QjZvbvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Relieve Back and Neck Discomfort: The Japanese shikibuton mattress has been used for ages to help alleviate posture issues, back pain, and neck discomfort. Experience the benefits of a natural sleeping surface for better back health on this comfy, thin mattress for the floor. Convenient Minimalistic Design: Our floor mattress is a portable, twin size futon that takes up minimal space and can be easily folded and stored when not in use. It comes with a twin mattress storage bag with a zipper for hassle-free storage and transportation. The twin Shiki futon mattress is ideal for an adult. It is 75\" (6ft 3in) long and 39\" (3ft 3in) wide with a thickness of 2.25 in. Worried about stains, We have you Covered: Your Japanese cotton pad comes with white fitted cover that is breathable, and washable, providing protection for your floor futon mattress. Relax on your floor mattress firm and enjoy a hygienic sleeping surface indoors or outdoors. Soft and Supportive: Our triple-layered floor futon is designed to be both soft and supportive. The outer fabric is 100% cotton, while the filling is made of soft, fluffy polyester and a hard structural core for added support. Sleep soundly on this comfortable and portable futon mattress twin. Versatile & Giftable: Not only does the futon is a marvellous Japanese bed, but can be used for meditation & yoga. Makes a plush, yet light camping bed. An excellent gift for friends or family. A useful housewarming gift. Securely Packaged & Satisfaction Guaranteed: Buy with complete confidence and rest easy knowing that your futon will arrive promptly in perfect condition in the care of our secure, protective packaging. 100% satisfaction Guarantee from Iyasu Home","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o-QjZvbvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iyasu Home","source_asin":"B09F8GM871","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F8GM871","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F8GM871","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
