window.products.push({"id":419065,"name":"Global Carving-Knives, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Cxh+t2IJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect for everything from carving turkey or ham to slicing roast beef, this slicing knife features a long, super-sharp cutting edge that makes it great for delivering thin, uniform slices. Designed by the legendary bladesmiths at Global and only available at Sur La Table, the handcrafted Ni cutlery collection offers the cutting-edge performance and precision craftsmanship for which Global is famous-all with a new, innovative design that's engineered to feel like an extension of the hand. FEATURES New blade geometry designed exclusively for Sur La Table balances graceful, modern design with precision and durability for the ultimate in performance at the cutting board. Forged from a single piece of stainless steel for the ultimate in strength, durability and performance. Lightweight G18 CROMOVA steel takes and holds a lasting edge-even at the ultra-sharp 12.5A Degree angle used in Japanese cutlery. Rounded spine ensures comfort while using a professional pinch grip. Features a long, super-sharp cutting edge for delivering thin, uniform slices. Sleek, ergonomic handles are designed to maximize comfort and control and are precisely weighted for impeccable balance. Seamless design is hygienic and easy to maintain. Manufacturer: Global. Material: Stainless steel. Care: Hand wash only. Dimensions: 9.25\" blade, 14.25\" overall. Made in Japan. ?.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Cxh+t2IJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Global","source_asin":"B00YNU7D58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YNU7D58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YNU7D58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
