window.products.push({"id":419094,"name":"Gocheer HEPA Filter Replacement Air Purifier, 4-in-1 Filter Include Pet Pure Treatment Pre-Filter, True HEPA Filter, Activated Carbon Filter, 2Pcs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813ITon-h+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Large Coverage and All-round Cleaning: CADR 1,000, easily cleans up to 4,410 sq ft in one hour, 2,500 sq ft in 30 minutes, 1,102 sq ft in 15 minutes (CADR 1000). This allows you to run the unit at lower speeds and still easily clean the air in your rooms. Medium to large rooms between 262 square feet and 459 square feet. Such as bedrooms, big living rooms, hospitals, and offices. Dual H13 Ture HEPA Filters: Combined activated carbon and a true HEPA filter to deliver true HEPA performance capturing 99.97% of particulates and allergens larger than 0.3 microns, makes your air cleaner and fresher so you can breathe easier. Dual intake also creates better airflow. Advanced Touch Screen Panel: Touch screen panel, 4 fan speeds, sleep mode, and child lock. has a timer with 1, 2, 4, and 8-hour settings, plus indicators for filter lifetime for both the washable pre-filter and filter. Smart and Wifi Control: Smart mode with 3 settings, Gocheer smart air purifier adapts to its surroundings. The lighting conditions are automatically adjusted according to the fan speed. If you don’t need the light, you can press and hold the button for 3 seconds to turn it off. Wi-Fi enabled for control through the Smart app compatible Dual Protection Filters Sold Separately: We provide an extra level of carbon filtration to remove odors and smoke including those caused by wildfires. The product itself comes with 2 original filter elements. We suggested being replaced every 3~6 months depending on use. Genuine Gocheer replacement filters are in Amazon stock. Search for \"B08L4V2JLC\" on Amazon to purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813ITon-h+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gocheer","source_asin":"B08L4V2JLC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L4V2JLC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L4V2JLC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
