window.products.push({"id":419140,"name":"Tramean 60\"x80\" 15 lbs Weighted Blanket for Adults, Queen Size, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZoZwSNymL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE SLEEP COMPANION: If you have problems with sleeping, sleep deprivation or even more serious conditions , then we have an item which can help you get the peaceful sleep you have been dreaming of for a long time: the Tramean weighted blanket. It will give you a comfortable hugging feeling and a sweet dreaming night. 7-LAYERED PREMIUM BLANKET: Tramean’s 7-layered blanket is designed to offer comfort. We use the most advanced technology and the highest-quality materials to produce the ideal weighted blanket. The breathable, 100%-cotton outer layer is lined with two extra polyester layers that contain millions of premium micro glass beads. This unique structure provides optimal temperature control and prevents from leaking beads. SIZE & WEIGHT: 60\"x80\" 20lbs, Suitable for 170-220lbs individual. Please choose the blanket that weighs about 10% of your body weight + or - depending on individual preference. GIFT IDEA: Tramean Weight Blankets can be used not only while sleeping, but also can be used while reading, resting, watching TV on couch. It is a breathable blankets that can be used in all the four season. A great gift idea for families and friends on Birthday, or other holiday. It will help your loved ones fall asleep faster and sleep more deeply. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We LOVE our customers and take pride in providing a pleasant shopping experience. Please keep in mind, it usually takes about a week to get used to the blanket’s weight. If for any reason you’re unhappy with your purchase, we offer a full refund— no questions asked! We are always happy to hear from you, so please don’t hesitate to get in touch with us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZoZwSNymL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tramean","source_asin":"B07HFRTN1V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419140","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HFRTN1V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HFRTN1V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
