window.products.push({"id":419293,"name":"Simple&Opulence 100% Linen Boho Duvet Cover,3pcs Bohemian Textured Collection Bedding Set for All Seasons,French Country Comforter Cover Set with Pill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vxgq9NZfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Material】100% Flax Linen with Stone Washed.High-quality linen will be more durable than cotton fabric,thermal conductivity and moisture absorption will far exceed cotton fabric, it can quickly release the absorbed moistureand it is not easy to fade and shrink.linen Fabric will get softer with each wash.Oeko-Tex Standard 100 certified material. 【What You Can Get】3 Pieces Linen Duvet Cover Sets include:1 duvet cover and 2 pillow shams.Queen Size duvet cover (88”x92”),2 pillow shams size (20”x26”) Note:This product dose not include the comforter.Duvet insert sold separately.Pls Search B08SR3NX5J ▲Tips:Every set includes 2 spare buttons. ▲Matching Euro Sham:If you need Extra Euro Shams,Pls Search B08B8DJJHR. 【Unique Design & Gift】Simple&Opulence will bring you a bohemian collection of true luxury. Handcrafted tassel fringed,unique weaving technology. This bedding set with tassel-trimmed edges,delicate, chic,elegant and decorative.This luxurious bohemian bedding adds a sophisticated, textural touch to your space. It is a good choice for your friends and family. (Birthday/Mother’s Day/Christmas/Wedding gift/Housewarming gift ...) 【Corner Ties & Button Closure】Linen duvet cover has 4 interior corner ties inside, secure your comforter or duvet in right place to ensure tight sleep. The closure type is button, it has a fold cover that helps protect the buttons from being kicked loose.the see-through hidden button closure makes the quilt look more holistic. 【Use Instruction】Wash under 60℃;Warm Iron; Tumble dry with medium heat ;Wash with similar colors; Wash dark color separately.Please close the button when washing to avoid tearing.▲▲TIPS:Machine washable, but would suggest wash delicate cycle if you can because of the edge with tassels. Inside out and No bleach!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vxgq9NZfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simple&Opulence","source_asin":"B09F5WMPB1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F5WMPB1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F5WMPB1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
