window.products.push({"id":419442,"name":"Martex Organic Quilt, King, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HP4iNJUfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Under the Canopy’s Organic Cotton Quilt is the perfect piece for those who care about their impact on the planet. It’s made with sustainable organic cotton that’s both soft and durable. Crafted with cotton that has been OEKO-TEX and GOTS certified – this quilt is healthy for you and the environment. The irregular dash quilt stitch provides an organic, handcrafted texture and the gentle pre-washing process allows for lived-in comfort and a soft hand feel. Woven in a breathable percale fabric for year round comfort, this quilt is also machine washable for low-maintenance, easy care. Under the Canopy’s Organic Cotton Quilt is available in a nature inspired palette (blue, grey and white,) and pairs perfectly with the Under the Canopy Organic Cotton Shams to complete your bed set. 100% Organic Cotton and Machine Washable Twin: 68\"W x 90\"L; Full/Queen: 92\"W x 96\"L; King: 110\"W x 96\"L","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HP4iNJUfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Martex","source_asin":"B07D48XM5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D48XM5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D48XM5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":419443,"name":"Totally Bamboo Salad Server","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.48,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AX1QmxC6L._AC_.jpg","description":"From the original bamboo cutting board company, Totally Bamboo, this 14-inch salad server set is a beautiful, functional, ecologically sound addition to any kitchen. Bamboo is actually a grass that grows to a harvestable height of 60 feet in about 3 to 5 years, growing as much as 2 feet per day. It has an extensive root system that continually sends up new shoots, naturally replenishing itself. It does not require replanting, making it one of the most renewable resources known. Totally Bamboo uses 'Moso' timber bamboo which is neither a food source nor a habitat for the Giant Panda. Totally Bamboo's salad servers are assembled with approved food-grade glue -- none of their products are made with formaldehyde-based glue. No dyes or stains are used in the manufacturing process. The pleasing designs are created by using the naturally-occurring variations within the wood grain. Totally Bamboo prides itself on using only premium hand-selected bamboo, innovative design, exemplary craftmanship, and fair labor policies.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AX1QmxC6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Totally Bamboo","source_asin":"B0002LXUEA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002LXUEA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002LXUEA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":419444,"name":"4 Pack - Cafe Bakery Soy Blend Scented Wax Melts Wax Cubes, 10.0 oz, [24 Cubes] with Coffee Shop, Blue Berry Scone, Maple Pumpkin Muffin and Cafe Doug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dsC2g8grL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Cafe Bakery variety 4 pack Collection wax cubes produce a memorable aromatic home fragrance experience when used in a wax tart melter or burner. Coffee Shop -- Among the coffee wax melts, Coffee shop offers the rich, deep scent experience of coffee house beans or fresh ground espresso, cappuccino even latte aromatics. Blueberry Scone -- Everyone loves the smell of freshed baked goods whether it's cake, cookies or the classic buttery sweet scent of a sugar scone. Maple Pumpkin Muffin -- The light autumn harvest version of pumpkin fragrance allows the maple to mingle with delicate squash unmarred by traditional spices of nutmeg or cinnamon. Cafe Donuts -- Here is where the cinnamon shines, wafting across a vanilla buttercream wave of baked goodness only fifty trays of warm donuts could release.  BAC Home wax melts are loaded with the maximum fragrance oil possible in each wax cube - over 10% oil to wax ratio. It’s not triple or doubled scented wax. It’s the most possible. We favor natural aromas. The strength of each scent will vary in intensity to fill from one to multiple rooms in your home or office. BAC uses a soy wax blend made from hydrogenated natural soy bean oils, a renewable and sustainable material. To promote eco awareness without compromising function, BAC incorporates the more traditional, harder paraffin wax for a stronger throw. BAC Home wax melts are phthalate-free or contain essential oils where indicated. They may be used for aromatherapy, but have no medical value. Chill to release stuck cubes. All BAC Home wax melts are handmade in a small, cold state near Canada at a small family owned business and get individual attention. There are no robots. No machines. No underpaid factory workers. Just real people passionate about scented candle wax.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dsC2g8grL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAC Home","source_asin":"B07KTC82LN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KTC82LN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KTC82LN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":419445,"name":"Carolina Cottage Folding Library Ladder Chair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CyxLfRWhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Carolina Cottage Folding Library Ladder Chair. The chair that goes from a chair to a handy step ladder. Said to originally be designed by Benjamin Franklin. Handy doesn't begin to describe how useful you'll find this 2-in-1 Library Ladder Chair. Use it as a chair until you need a step ladder. Simply undo the hinge and flip it over for a handy step ladder. This chair is made from solid select Asian hardwood. Some assembly is required. Materials: Wood, MDF, Veneer Dimensions: 20\"L x 16.5\"W x 34\"H Weight: 20 lbs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CyxLfRWhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carolina Cottage","source_asin":"B00XJUBURU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XJUBURU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XJUBURU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
