window.products.push({"id":419468,"name":"Dream Star Cervical Memory Foam Pillow, Orthopedic Contour Pillow for Neck Pain Relief Sleeping, Ergonomic Cervical Pillow for Back/Side/Stomach Sleep","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FWm8cpPwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【🌙100% Premium High Density Memory Pillow】Pillowcase is made of 30% Tencel and 70% Polyester. Tencel has excellent moisture absorption and breathability and has a unique silky touch. Affinity material, durable and elastic, easy to clean, bring a more comfortable sleeping experience. 【🌙Ergonomic Design】Special hollow design supports the head, helps to maintain the natural cervical curve of the neck and the arrangement of the vertebrae, maintains good blood flow to the neck and head, relieves pressure and eliminates muscle tension. It can effectively support the cervical spine without affecting the comfort, maintain the correct state of the cervical spine, and effectively improve snoring and shoulder and neck discomfort. 【🌙Away from neck and shoulder pain】Dream Star neck pillow uses high-quality high-density slow-rebound memory foam with moderate hardness to ensure comfortable support during sleep. Neck pillows help maintain proper sleeping position for neck and shoulder pain relief. 【🌙Ideal pillow for back/side sleeping】Neck pillow for belly, back and side sleeping. When sleeping on your back, the natural traction of the neck and head support reduces pressure on the back of the skull and improves sleep quality. When sleeping on the side, make sure the cutouts under the wings fit snugly against the curve of the shoulders to reduce shoulder pressure and allow each sleeper to find a sleeping position that suits them. 【🌙Sleep well】Dream Star Neck Pillow provides all the curves and angles needed to help relieve stress, more delicate and thoughtful contour design than others, quickly forms a body curve that fits your head and neck, accelerates sleep, and allows you to have better Refined and comfortable sleep. 【🌙High-quality after-sales service】A good night's sleep will make your life better, so a good neck pillow is a must. If you need any assistance, please feel free to contact us, we provide a 100% satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FWm8cpPwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dream Star","source_asin":"B09NBM2PKW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419468","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NBM2PKW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NBM2PKW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
