window.products.push({"id":419515,"name":"COTA Global Sea Turtle Plush Refrigerator Magnet - Green Tortoise Stuffed Plush Magnet, Cute Ocean Life Magnet for Kitchen Fridge & Locker, Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l1mkc5XrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE SEA TURTLE PLUSH TOY MAGNET DECOR COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Bring out the kid in you & display your collection of animal novelty magnets! Soft & fluffy home decor to add cuteness to any surface that attracts magnets. CoTa Global's Sea Turtle Plush Fridge Magnet will surely attract anyone who sees the adorable stuffed magnet decor. A must-have home & office accessory to use as convenient note holders & home or office decor. THE COOL FRIDGE MAGNETS ARE FOR WHIMSICAL NOVELTIES LOVERS – Perfect home & office ornament for magnet collectors and animal lovers who'd like to add funky decor magnets to their stationery to help them stay organized. Surprise your colleagues with entertaining unique and decorative plush magnets to hang pictures, memories, pictures, or random notes. Ideal for parents who love leaving cute notes for their little ones or to post grocery lists. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF CUTE REFRIGERATOR MAGNET - Includes 1 CoTa Global Green Sea Turtle Plush Fridge Magnet. The collectible magnet features a cute & cuddly turtle decorated with soft plush flippers and shell. The unique magnetic decor is designed with realistic animal details & colored with high-quality, vibrant green making it the perfect accent for plain-colored refrigerators. Cute kitchen fridge magnet measures about 4 inches. HIGH-QUALITY OCEAN LIFE PLUSH ANIMAL MAGNET – Fun magnets for refrigerator & locker are made of 100% polyester materials with high-quality soft fillings and a strong magnet attached to the back of the 3D-shaped plush turtle figure. The magnetic turtle plush figure looks so adorable with its little plastic eyes. Use the beautifully designed plush sea turtle magnetic home decor to add an irresistibly charming accessory to your stationery. IDEAL USE FOR THE NAUTICAL ANIMAL REFRIGERATOR MAGNET - Decorate your kitchen fridge door, dishwasher, locker, whiteboards, cabinet, & any metal surfaces that attract magnets with fun novelty magnets. Sea turtle magnets make a cool display on the kitchen fridge & an amusing locker decor to help in posting notes, recipes, checklists, reminders, photos, & drawings. A perfectly functional and multi-use magnet for the home or any office work-space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l1mkc5XrS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B017ZAU7H8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419515","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017ZAU7H8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017ZAU7H8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":419516,"name":"AQUATEC ERP 500 PERMEATE PUMP ERP500 PERMEATE PUMP With 1/4\" JG INSERTS MOUNTING HARDWARE INCLUDING CLIP AND SCREWS","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yok5w-JxL._AC_.jpg","description":"ERP-500 permeate pump is a simple, yet revolutionary, device. Powered only by the hydraulic energy of brine water, the ERP-500 requires no electricity. the permeate pump forces product water into the storage tank, reducing membrane back pressure and maximizing available feed pressure. Dramatically improves the efficiency of RO water production, reducing wastewater by up to 80%. The permeate pump can also bring storage tanks up to line pressure and shut the system down when the tank reaches capacity, eliminating the need for an ASO valve. Other benefits include higher delivery pressures, faster RO water production, superior water quality, and extended filter/membrane life. Includes a sound suppression insert which helps the system operate in near silence. Package includes ERP-500 pump, mounting clip, and SS screws. The ERP500 can easily be retrofitted to existing RO systems. Install after RO flow restrictor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yok5w-JxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aqua Tec","source_asin":"B00I3VKHSI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I3VKHSI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I3VKHSI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
