window.products.push({"id":419629,"name":"DYJKOUG 40 Pieces Cupcake Embroidered Patches, Ice Cream Fabric Patches, DIY Sewing Craft Iron On Patches, Cute Decoration for Clothing Jackets Hat Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ki0Gc1zXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Item Type: patches Quantity: 40pcs Size: as picture shows Material: fabric,polyester Pattern: cupcake,ice cream,donuts Package included: 40pcs (20 different patterns, 2pcs for each pattern) Sewing/Ironing: 1.Preparation: Embroidered patches (with hot melt adhesive on the back), clothes (or whatever you want), electric iron, a clean cloth or towel. 2.Temperature: Set the temperature of the iron to the cotton position. 3.Position: Put cupcake patches on the position where you want to iron 4.Cover: Cover the patches with cloth or towel to prevent the iron from scalding the patches. 5.Ironing: Cover the iron completely with the subsidy pressure and press it with a small force for about 20 seconds. The tip of the iron can be used to iron a few times along the edge of the cloth. 6.Reinforcement: Turn the clothes upside down, and iron them again with an iron to fix them. 7.Worry about the patches falling off after washing, you can re-attach the edge stitches to reinforce. Warning: - When ironing, the temperature of the electric iron is high, please pay attention to safety and keep away from kids. - During the ironing process, please do not get any water on the clothes and iron, otherwise it will affect the ironing effect. - Sweater/leather/net yarn and other fabrics with uneven surfaces, it is recommended to use sewing methods. Service: If you're not completely satisfied simply let us know and we will offer a prompt refund or replacement","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91ki0Gc1zXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DYJKOUG","source_asin":"B091PXVGMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091PXVGMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091PXVGMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":419630,"name":"Magnetic Lint Bin - Laundry Room Decor Accessories, Waste Holder with Cleaning Wire Brush - Magnetic Strip Attachment on Washer & Dryer - Farmhouse La","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712KG-WwZdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for a way to save space in your laundry room? Laundry areas are often smaller than other rooms and can only fit a few appliances, such as a washer and dryer. Because of this, we should know how to maximize our space, so it doesn't look stuffy and cluttered. One way we can clear our path is by getting rid of unnecessary items such as large trash cans. After all, there's not much to throw away in our utility rooms except for lint. If you want a container for your fluffs, then going for a wall-mounted lint bin will solve your storage problems while giving you more legroom. Level up your area with our convenient AMP Premier Products Lint Bin! Place this compact bin on your walls or on your machines to save up floor space. Its strong magnetic backing allows you to attach it to any metal surface, while the key-ring hole lets you effortlessly mount it on your walls. With this, you don't have to stumble into garbage cans again while you're carrying big piles of clothes. Putting this container in easy-to-reach places also rids you of the need to bend over and potentially hurt your back. More than that, installing this farmhouse style bin in an eye-level area makes for a charming décor and serves as a constant reminder for your family to clean out the washer and dryer after using it. We've also made tidying up your vents better with our wire brush that lets you remove dirt buildup in your pipes or vents. This way, you can collect all the lint from your machine and repurpose them. You can add them to your compost pit or use them as stuffing for your handcrafted pillows or stuffed toys. Still not convinced? Here are more reasons you'll love this bin: ✅ Made with sturdy plastic ✅ Use it for detergent pods or wool balls ✅ Great gift for friends and family Have more space in your washrooms. Add the AMP Premier Products Lint Bin to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712KG-WwZdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMP Premier Products","source_asin":"B09DR8MKPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419630","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DR8MKPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DR8MKPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
