window.products.push({"id":419861,"name":"Twin Mattress Topper 3 Inch Memory Foam Topper, Cooling Gel Egg Crate Foam Bed Topper, Marine Moon High-Density Mattress Topper, Removable Soft Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YNCzqmgEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔹Instantly Improve Any Mattress: A 3-inch mattress topper is a perfect addition to a mattress, which could add softness and offer extra support. You will not make excessive sinking. Memory foam mattress topper stays true to your body’s needs with a weightless comfort that feels like you’re sleeping on a cloud. Get amazing comfort for less money and extend the life of your mattress! 🔹Cooler Restful Sleep: Cooling gel-infused memory foam and the ups and downs egg crate foam structure design can improve breathability and airflow, keep you cool all night. Cooling Mattress topper maximizes comfort regulation for the restorative sleep possible. In addition, we added a moisture-absorbing thin cover between the outer cover and the 3-inch memory foam. The double-layer cover can effectively reduce the memory foam tears and play a double protection role for gel memory foam. 🔹Total Pressure Point Relief: Highly- Adaptive memory foam conforms to the curves of your body, distributes weight evenly to align the spine, and provides the best relief and support for the pressure points like your shoulders, back, and hips. The breathable gel mattress topper reduces your body burden effectively and stays cool this summer. 🔹Washable Non-slip Cover: Adopting the latest weaving technology, Our removable & machine washable cover is soft to touch and with high durability. The back of the cover is evenly distributed with small non-slip particles. And this twin bed mattress topper has 4 elastic straps adapting to mattress depths up to 18\", which can help the extra thick bed topper stay securely in place throughout the night. 🔹30-Night Trial: Before first use, please leave the soft mattress topper flatly in a well-ventilated area for 48-72 hours until it’s fully expanded. It is normal for the new foam to have a slight smell, and the egg crate mattress topper will dissipate within 72 hours. We are 24/7 available to answer your questions. Take the cooling mattress topper a trial with no risk!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YNCzqmgEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marine Moon","source_asin":"B09YYC9GL3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YYC9GL3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YYC9GL3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":419862,"name":"Mocassi Queen Sheet Set - Luxury Hotel 1800 Thread Count Bedding Sheets & Pillowcases - Ultra Soft Breathable & Cooling Bed Sheet Set - Wrinkle Resist","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iikMBnOTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mocassi Queen-size Dimensions - Flat sheet 102\" x 90\", Fitted sheet 80\" x 60\", 4 pillowcases 20\" x 30\" - Fits Mattresses up to 16\" - Thickness, softness and warmth breathable, stronger and more durable than cotton, with the strongest stitching to prevent tears Deep-pocket, fully elasticized fitted sheet for mattresses up to 16 Inch thick Wrinkle- and fade-resistant, cold-water washable and quick-drying WELCOME TO MOCASSI: Extra Durable weave creates an everlasting softness. Discover the ultimate in high-end bedding with our silky-smooth bedding. Breathable, and cool to the touch, our luxuriously soft bedding set will create a heavenly sleeping experience! The microfiber material is processed to make it resistant to wrinkle, shrinkage and fading which adds to the longevity of the set by keeping it in great condition. LUXURY MEETS PERFORMANCE: Mocassi provides superior performance and luxurious feel begin with yarns that are even finer, longer, and stronger than silk. These microfiber yarns are finished with a meticulous brushing and conditioning process before being woven into premium fabrics, then undergo an additional brushing to attain the lustrous, ultra soft finish sought by connoisseurs of fine linens. VIBRANT, FADE-RESISTANT COLORS: Mocassi microfiber is made to look as good as it feels. It's exceptionally color-fast, and even after years of regular use will look as vibrant as the first night you enjoyed it. EASY CARE: They are as soft as 1800 thread count Egyptian cotton and durable than the highest thread count cotton. Its ultrafine yarns and micro ventilated weave repel sweat and stains, making a short cold-water wash and a quick tumble dry on low heat all you need to keep these linens fresh and clean. They won't be weaken or tear even after years of use, maintaining a smooth, wrinkle-resistant that only improves with time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iikMBnOTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mocassi","source_asin":"B09PZJK8SF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PZJK8SF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PZJK8SF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
