window.products.push({"id":419987,"name":"GRABADO Handmade Large Ceramic Bowl 60oz Ceramic Bowl for Kitchen Ceramic Serving Bowl Glazed Ceramic Popcorn Bowl 8\" Ramen Bowl Ceramic Dishwasher & ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w1EpoUTYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Craftsman Quality】This ceramic salad bowl is made of high-quality pottery clay and is made of glaze changing technology in the kiln. The whole is thick and smooth, comfortable to touch, sturdy and durable, lead-free, non-toxic, and the surface is not easy to scratch, so you can use it with confidence. 【The unique beauty of glaze-changing pottery】When making a ceramic blue serving bowl, two kinds of glazes are manually applied on the inside and outside of the bowl. After high temperature kiln transformation, the glazes are naturally fused, giving it a unique streamlined beauty, which can be used as a decorative bowl in the kitchen or living room to increase the appetite of you and your family. 【Dishwasher Safe】Ceramic food bowl are easy to clean and can be used in oven, dishwasher, microwave, sterilizer, steamer, refrigerator and more. Ceramic fruit bowl are perfect for salads, pasta, ramen, desserts and more to enhance your dining experience. 【Each is different】The high-temperature glaze changing technology can make the pottery very beautiful, and because it's hand-made, there will be slight deviations in the amount of glaze and the firing temperature. It is normal for each salad bowl you receive to have a slight color difference. 【Looking forward to your satisfaction】 We use thickened damage-proof packaging for the products, but the ceramic bowl is fragile, and it is inevitable that there will be occasional damage during transportation. If you receive a broken or unsatisfactory ceramic bowl, don't worry, please contact us immediately, we will try to provide you with a better solution. 【Large Capacity】The large ceramic bowl is 8 inches in diameter and 3.5 inches in height, and the capacity is 60 oz/1700 ml. It can meet your different usage scenarios and meet the needs of different types of food. This pasta bowl is also great for cereals, soups, stews, stir-fries, seafood, casseroles, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w1EpoUTYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRABADO","source_asin":"B0B1C47T44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1C47T44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1C47T44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
