window.products.push({"id":419991,"name":"Tea Talent Reservoir Portable Travel Type Tea Tray - Japanese/Chinese Kungfu Tea Set Bamboo Box Gongfu Tea Table Serving Tray 11 x 6.3 x 2.56 Inch, Or","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.81,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SotzMz+bL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Tea tray is an important ingredient in Gongfu brewing because of the wet and messy nature of the process. YOU NEED A TRAY - Gongfu style tea requires pouring away the water used to warm the teapot,tea brewer and cups, and the first rinse of the leaves is also discarded.Rinse your cups and teapot using the interior of the tray to catch the waste water. YOU NEED A TRAY - Placed the tea pot,tea cups,gaiwan,tea filter etc. This tea tray is used for brewing tea in the traditional Chinese Gong Fu style. This tea tray is suitable for Gongfu-style tea service for 1 - 4 people using Gongfu teaware. This tea tray is suitable for use in the living room, dining room, kitchen, balcony gardens,with family and friends together to taste the fragrance of Chinese Kung Fu tea. It's Tea Time! Tea is served to enhance a good meal or conclude a festive gathering in a spirit of sharing. Offer your guests the opportunity to share in this tradition with this authentic Japanese & Chinese tea set. Benefit: *Often drinking tea can help fresh you from daily fatigue, and enhance your memory than ever. * Tea is calorie-free. Drinking tea can also help decompose the fat; people who love drinking tea look slimmer than the others. *Drinking tea can calm yourself down and slow you down from aging. *Tea helps keep you hydrated. *Tea gives healthier teeth and gums. Features: - It suitable for brewing black tea, green tea, scented tea, pu-er tea and other daily consumption and entertain at home. - Easy to use, convenient, great choice for home use, travelling and gifting. - Package includes teapot,tea cups,tea tray. - Convenient for travelling outdoor car office use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SotzMz+bL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tea Talent","source_asin":"B01FZQN9A6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-419991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FZQN9A6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FZQN9A6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
